  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are difficult to perceive for creatures that rely on non-visual cues.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dampen Presence<sup>DH</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use the Stealth skill to hide from any creature attempting to perceive you using blindsense, blindsight, lifesense, or tremorsense. When using Dampen Presence, creatures using those senses take a penalty on Perception to detect you checks equal to your mythic tier (or one-half your mythic tier, if they are mythic creatures). In addition, you can expend one use of mythic power to force all creatures using those senses to detect you to roll twice and select the worse result on their Perception checks made to oppose your Stealth check. You must decide to use this ability before making your Stealth check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc77\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
